smarttab — RK3288 tablet, Alpine + mainline Linux (notes: HANDOFF.md on the PC)
  gui start [--rotate 0|90]   Weston desktop (landscape default), gui stop to return to console
  gui start kiosk -- <app>    single fullscreen app        gui status | gui log
